.TH LIFE 1
.SH NAME
life \- Conway's Game of Life
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/life
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Life
implements Conway's Game of Life.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 1 paints live cells while the simulation runs. The r key randomizes; space clears.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB
Paint live cells
.TP
.B r
Randomize
.TP
.B space
Clear
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/life.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
